   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening PNGs Parliament Project (UNDP PNG 00132510)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Papua New Guinea (PNG) Parliament sits at the apex of national governance.In a Westminster parliamentary system like PNG&#x2019;s, the executive branch sitswithin the legislative branch, making parliament one of the most importantsites of national discussion, debate, and action. The Bougainville House ofRepresentatives (BHoR) plays a similar role in the Autonomous Region ofBougainville (AROB) under their regional Constitution. Recognising the criticalimportance of both institutions to democratic go</narrative>
  </description>
